+---
+id: "n_0212_61c6"
+type: "note"
+title: "gh-146 retired the machine-kit layer in dmtools-dart: machine-kit/teammate-install/, machine-kit/templates/, machine-kit/setup.sh and machine-kit/README.md are GONE. Supersessions for older notes that name machine-kit paths: per-leg runners now live in .dmtools/runners/*.json (bug/story/review/rework) selected by the factory guard via .dmtools/config.js sm.runners; github_comment_format.md and review_verdict_rules.md live in the agents/ submodule (instructions/common/ and instructions/pr_review/), referenced by runners as ./factory-agents/... (factory CI checks out dmtools-agents beside the target repo as factory-agents/); review-verdict.sh and install-source-git-credentials.sh live in agents/setup/. machine-kit/scripts/install-source-git-credentials.sh is the ONLY kept machine-kit file (release-cli.yml still calls it). Machine contract tests: test/machine_kit/machine_sm_watchdog_test.dart (stub+factory workflow contracts), runner_wiring_test.dart (.dmtools runner wiring — parents resolve only in CI, so tests pin raw runner JSON + agents/ copies), source_git_credentials_test.dart + review_verdict_test.dart (target agents/.github/workflows/factory/teammate.yml), ai_teammate_review_cycle_test.dart (same factory workflow)."
